{%- comment -%}
  Paste this into the TRMNL Private Plugin "Markup" editor for the
  bus-grabo plugin (Polling strategy), "Full" tab.

  LAYOUT: a departure-board grid (inspired by a transit-app "next trains"
  screen - line badge + boxed time + destination, one row per upcoming
  departure) for each board, framed left/right by that board's own pixel-art
  bus icon like a picture frame. Two boards, side by side: line 525 at
  Mjörn (towards Gråbo) and line X3 at Gråbo busstation (towards Göteborg) -
  two DIFFERENT lines/buses that happen to meet at Gråbo, not one
  continuous route (see fetch.mjs's top-of-file "LINE CORRECTION" note for
  why this matters).

  Icon direction: fetch.mjs's icons (generate-bus-icons.mjs) are drawn
  nose-first towards the RIGHT (mirrored via sharp's .flop()/PIL's
  FLIP_LEFT_RIGHT - see that file's header comment for why an earlier
  version had them backwards), so placed at the LEFT edge of the frame they
  read as driving INTO the departure grid next to them - both boards' icons
  use the same orientation, they aren't flipped per-side.

  Every text line uses "label" so size/font stays identical and pixelated
  throughout (see README's "Markup style" section).

  IMPORTANT rendering rules (both learned the hard way - see README):
  1. class="image image--contain image-dither" (not just "image") on every
     <img>, and each icon is a single LONE <img> - never a flex sibling of
     another <img>.
  2. Every icon's <img> lives inside its own table cell (plain <table>/<td>,
     not TRMNL's styled table component, and not a bare
     <div class="layout layout--row">) - a bare flex-row wrapper let the
     surrounding layout stretch icons into a tall narrow sliver instead of
     their real landscape shape on a real device; table cells don't have
     that problem. The whole departure-grid frame below is one <table> for
     this same reason - it's a plain HTML grid for layout, not TRMNL's
     "table" component (README explains the distinction), so it doesn't
     affect the label font.

  Position map: a single generated PNG (bus_position.map_image_url) showing
  Sjövik -- Mjörn -- Gråbo as three dots on a line, with a marker for each
  departure's live GPS-derived position along that stretch (see fetch.mjs's
  renderPositionMap()/resolveRoute()/describeDeparturePosition()).

  Bottom section: "Senaste position" (last seen) - one row per board, each
  repeating that board's own icon plus the nearest real bus stop name
  (last_seen.location_text - always a place name like "Mjörn" or "Göteborg",
  never a percentage-along-route figure, and shown even when the sighting
  is from that line running a different direction or route variant - see
  fetch.mjs's nearestStopName()) and a timestamp (last_seen.seen_at_display).
  Unlike bus_location above (which is often "unknown" between trips),
  last_seen is designed to always have something to show once any sighting
  has ever been recorded - see fetch.mjs's buildLastSeen().
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="layout layout--col gap--medium">

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td rowspan="3" style="width: 68px; border: none; padding: 4px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;">
        <img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ mjorn_to_grabo.icon_url }}" width="60" height="30" style="width: 60px; height: 30px;">
      </td>
      <td colspan="3" style="border: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #000; padding: 0 0 4px 0; text-align: center;">
        <div class="label">MJÖRN &gt; GRÅBO</div>
      </td>
      <td colspan="3" style="border: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #000; padding: 0 0 4px 0; text-align: center;">
        <div class="label">GRÅBO &gt; GBG</div>
      </td>
      <td rowspan="3" style="width: 68px; border: none; padding: 4px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;">
        <img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ grabo_to_goteborg.icon_url }}" width="60" height="30" style="width: 60px; height: 30px;">
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      {% if mjorn_to_grabo.has_departure %}
      <td style="border: none; padding: 4px 6px 0 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.line }}</div></td>
      <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 2px 8px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.estimated_time }}{% if mjorn_to_grabo.delay_minutes > 0 %} (+{{ mjorn_to_grabo.delay_minutes }}){% endif %}</div></td>
      <td style="border: none; padding: 4px 6px 0 6px; text-align: left;"><div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.destination }}{% if mjorn_to_grabo.is_cancelled %} - INSTÄLLD{% endif %}</div></td>
      {% else %}
      <td colspan="3" style="border: none; padding: 4px 6px 0 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">Ingen avgång</div></td>
      {% endif %}

      {% if grabo_to_goteborg.has_departure %}
      <td style="border: none; padding: 4px 6px 0 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.line }}</div></td>
      <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 2px 8px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.estimated_time }}{% if grabo_to_goteborg.delay_minutes > 0 %} (+{{ grabo_to_goteborg.delay_minutes }}){% endif %}</div></td>
      <td style="border: none; padding: 4px 6px 0 6px; text-align: left;"><div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.destination }}{% if grabo_to_goteborg.is_cancelled %} - INSTÄLLD{% endif %}</div></td>
      {% else %}
      <td colspan="3" style="border: none; padding: 4px 6px 0 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">Ingen avgång</div></td>
      {% endif %}
    </tr>
    <tr>
      {% if mjorn_to_grabo.next_departure_time %}
      <td style="border: none; padding: 2px 6px 4px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.line }}</div></td>
      <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 2px 8px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.next_departure_time }}</div></td>
      <td style="border: none; padding: 2px 6px 4px 6px; text-align: left;"><div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.destination }}</div></td>
      {% else %}
      <td colspan="3"></td>
      {% endif %}

      {% if grabo_to_goteborg.next_departure_time %}
      <td style="border: none; padding: 2px 6px 4px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.line }}</div></td>
      <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 2px 8px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.next_departure_time }}</div></td>
      <td style="border: none; padding: 2px 6px 4px 6px; text-align: left;"><div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.destination }}</div></td>
      {% else %}
      <td colspan="3"></td>
      {% endif %}
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr><td style="border: none; padding: 0; text-align: center;"><img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ bus_position.map_image_url }}" width="480" height="56" style="width: 480px; height: 56px;"></td></tr>
  </table>

  <div class="layout layout--row" style="justify-content: space-between;">
    <div class="label">Sjövik</div>
    <div class="label">Mjörn</div>
    <div class="label">Gråbo</div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="label">SENASTE POSITION</div>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 48px; border: none; padding: 0 6px 0 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;">
        <img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ mjorn_to_grabo.icon_url }}" width="44" height="22" style="width: 44px; height: 22px;">
      </td>
      <td style="border: none; padding: 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: middle;">
        <div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.last_seen.bus_name | default: mjorn_to_grabo.line }}: {{ mjorn_to_grabo.last_seen.location_text }} - {{ mjorn_to_grabo.last_seen.seen_at_display }}</div>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 48px; border: none; padding: 0 6px 0 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;">
        <img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ grabo_to_goteborg.icon_url }}" width="44" height="22" style="width: 44px; height: 22px;">
      </td>
      <td style="border: none; padding: 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: middle;">
        <div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.last_seen.bus_name | default: grabo_to_goteborg.line }}: {{ grabo_to_goteborg.last_seen.location_text }} - {{ grabo_to_goteborg.last_seen.seen_at_display }}</div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</div>

<div class="title_bar">
  <span class="title">Bussar · Gråbo</span>
  <span class="instance">{{ updated_display }}</span>
</div>
